# A function selected through a conditional record retains its closure.

```catala
declaration scope ComputedProvider:
  input offset content integer
  output predicate content boolean depends on value content integer

scope ComputedProvider:
  definition predicate of value equals if value > offset then true else false

declaration scope ComputedFunction:
  input choose content boolean
  input x content integer
  internal provider content ComputedProvider
  output result content boolean

scope ComputedFunction:
  definition provider equals
    if choose then output of ComputedProvider with { -- offset: 0 }
    else output of ComputedProvider with { -- offset: 10 }
  definition result equals provider.predicate of x
```
